      "id": "claim_8890d297646b47c5a7ef7bfcd57bcbf1",
      "statement": "All three authentication paths (password, Cloudflare Access, gatekeeper sign-in) converge on a session token of the form `<userId>:<secret>` that the client stores and exchanges via `PublicApi.authenticate()` for an `AuthenticatedApi` capability.",
