    {
      "id": "claim_1dd8c10d174d46b499cc01a4f00e801d",
      "statement": "When `CF_ACCESS_AUD`/`CF_ACCESS_ISS` are set, every `/api` request must present a `cf-access-jwt-assertion` header verified with jose against the issuer's remote JWKS (issuer and audience checked); failures and missing email yield 403, cross-origin requests are rejected, and password login/signup endpoints refuse to run.",
