    {
      "id": "claim_f7287694915a4774ab16d3ab94118846",
      "statement": "Gatekeeper sign-in uses a `PendingLogin` Durable Object as a rendezvous: `startGatekeeperLogin` creates it under a random unique id and returns an `attempt` RPC stub (the client never sees the DO id), and disposing the stub abandons the attempt; the DO keeps waiters in memory with a one-time result stash and no durable storage.",
